# coffer terminfo — xterm-256color plus the coffer-specific overrides.
# Two deliberate divergences from xterm's own caps:
#   * cnorm only shows the cursor; xterm's forces blink off to match
#     xterm's steady default, but blink is a host setting here (it has
#     a configured default and the app can still set it with ?12 /
#     DECSCUSR), so cnorm must not stomp it.
#   * Se resets DECSCUSR to the configured initial style (CSI 7 SP q)
#     rather than xterm's literal steady block — for xterm those are
#     the same thing, here the terminal's own default is configurable.
coffer-vty-256color|coffer-256color|coffer|Coffer Terminal Emulator,
    use=xterm-256color,
    cnorm=\E[?25h,
    Se=\E[7 q,
    Tc,
    hs,
    tsl=\E]2;,
    fsl=\E\\,
    dsl=\E]2;\E\\,
    Smulx=\E[4\:%p1%dm,
    Setulc=\E[58\:2\:\:%p1%{65536}%/%d\:%p1%{256}%/%{255}%&%d\:%p1%{255}&%d%;m,
    Sync=\E[?2026%?%p1%{1}%-%tl%eh%;,
